  "details": "I feel like the hitbox for picking up items is too small when playing with the mouse.\n\nYou can move less than a cm horizontally from where the pickup prompt appears and suddenly it's like the item isn't even in front of you.\n\nThis also makes it very difficult to catch things. I see players trying to throw things to their friends and their friend looks as  if they didn't even try to catch it.\n\nBut I tried it myself and even though the object moved in a slow arc right in front of me, it felt like it wasn't even an object that I could catch.\n\nPicking up objects: fun, throwing things around: fun, not being able to do either of these things quickly and effectively: not fun.",
